      55.17,
      406.14,
      295.23,
      464.1
    ],
    "text": "I, Munasinghe Kariyawasam Appuhamilage Don SomadasaGunawardana, Minister of Lands, hereby declare, under Sub-section(1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land describedbelow is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      478.14,
      295.23,
      560.1
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called \u2018Rambawa Kele\u2019 in total extent ofabout 0.4856 Hectare, described in the Advance Tracing No. Aa/RMB/2013/819 and dated 19.12.2013, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Rambewa (F.V.P. 157) in KendeKorale West Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionof Rambewa in Anuradhapura District, North Central Province andbounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
