      547.2,
      423.18
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Rambawa Kele \u2013 Extent: About 0.4856 HectareNorth: Land claimed by Thuduwage Elis Nona and Road(Pradeshiya Sabha); East: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha); South: Remainingportion of land claimed by Thuduwage Jane Nona; West: RoadReservation.",
